<para>Set Extractor.</para>
<sect1 id="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_semantic_validator_1autotoc_md24_1s1"><sect2 id="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_semantic_validator_1autotoc_md24">
<title>SoC / DIP note</title><para>The default extractor uses built-in regex rules. To activate an LLM-backed extractor, build one via <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_legal_llm_adapter_1ac22f924bf2fa0daa44ab7539c4ead3e5" kindref="member">LegalLlmAdapter::buildExtractor()</ref></computeroutput> and inject it here. The <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_semantic_validator" kindref="compound">SemanticValidator</ref></computeroutput> remains entirely free of any <computeroutput>llm/</computeroutput> or <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_legal_llm_adapter" kindref="compound">LegalLlmAdapter</ref></computeroutput> knowledge — the caller provides the pre-built extractor.</para>
<para>Example: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>In<sp/>wiring<sp/>code<sp/>(not<sp/>in<sp/>ingestion/):</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">LegalLlmAdapter<sp/>adapter(bridge);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">DeonticExtractor<sp/>llm_extractor<sp/>=<sp/>adapter.buildExtractor(0.75);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_semantic_validator_1a30413f7e00cb2be95a27fcdf76d73820" kindref="member">SemanticValidator</ref><sp/>validator;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">validator.setExtractor(std::move(llm_extractor));</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>extractor</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Pre-configured <ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_deontic_extractor" kindref="compound">DeonticExtractor</ref> (moved in).</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">extractor</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Input parameter.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
Calls: std::move(). </para>
</sect2></sect1>
