    <briefdescription>
<para>Semantic validator for legal text extractions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Applies quality gates defined in <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_legal_quality_gates" kindref="compound">LegalQualityGates</ref></computeroutput> to a <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_deontic_extraction" kindref="compound">DeonticExtraction</ref></computeroutput> result and produces a <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_semantic_validation_result" kindref="compound">SemanticValidationResult</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
<para>The validator is injectable: supply a custom validation function via <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_semantic_validator_1a122cfb57a45924bc8bbbae73c2e11d68" kindref="member">setValidatorFn()</ref></computeroutput> to override the built-in logic (useful in tests or when wiring an LLM-based semantic checker in Phase 2).</para>
<para>Usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">DeonticExtractor<sp/>extractor;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_semantic_validator_1a30413f7e00cb2be95a27fcdf76d73820" kindref="member">SemanticValidator</ref><sp/>validator;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">validator.setQualityGates(LegalQualityGates{});</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>extraction<sp/>=<sp/>extractor.extract(text);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>result<sp/>=<sp/>validator.validate(extraction,<sp/>text);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(!result.is_valid)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>handle<sp/>required<sp/>gate<sp/>failure</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
